      "items": [
        "Iron was completely unknown to the people of the Indus Valley Civilization (Bronze Age site).",
        "Lothal features the world's earliest known artificial tidal dockyard.",
        "Dholavira in Gujarat is unique for its three-part city division (Citadel, Middle Town, Lower Town) and elaborate water harvesting systems.",
        "Kalibangan provides the earliest evidence of a ploughed field and fire altars."
